{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0211","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000039:text","row":29829,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら」","en":"“Here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800647","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000059:text","row":29830,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"紙袋ごと渡す。","en":"I hand her the whole paper bag.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800648","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00002","en":"I hand over the paper bag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:0000007f:text","row":29831,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"食物ごとき、自力でいくらでも調達できる人だけどなぁ。","en":"Not that food is any problem for someone who can procure as much as she wants on her own.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800649","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00003","en":"But as far as food goes, she's someone who can just make as much as she wants, inn'she.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says she can procure as much food as needed, not necessarily make it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":77,"start":52,"text":"make as much as she wants"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000151:text","row":29832,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん……」","en":"“Mm...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800650","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00004","en":"Youko: \"Mh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000173:text","row":29833,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"食べ始める。","en":"She starts eating.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800651","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00005","en":"She begins to eat.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:0000019f:text","row":29834,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ、また」","en":"“Well, see you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800652","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Well, bye.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000001c5:text","row":29835,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"歩き出す。","en":"I start walking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800653","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00007","en":"I walk away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000250:text","row":29836,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800654","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00008","en":"Youko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000270:text","row":29837,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"はむはむはむ","en":"Nibble nibble nibble.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800655","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00009","en":"Scarf, scarf, scarf.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000294:text","row":29838,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"食べながらついてきた……。","en":"She follows me while she eats...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800656","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00010","en":"She followed while still eating...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000002c6:text","row":29839,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"そこで、いじめることにした。","en":"So I decide to tease her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800657","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00011","en":"Therefore, I decided teasing will ensue.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000302:text","row":29840,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、曜子ちゃんちょっと」","en":"“Oh, Yoko, come here a second.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800658","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, Youko-chan, c'mere.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000395:text","row":29841,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"呼び寄せる。","en":"I beckon her over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800659","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00013","en":"I summon her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000003b9:text","row":29842,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"頭を抱えてつむじを押し込んだ。","en":"I take her head in my hands and press down on the crown.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800660","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00014","en":"Grabbing her head, I push hard into her hair whorl.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000475:text","row":29843,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「う、ううっ、それはだめ……だめ……おなかがくだるから……」","en":"“N-no, don't... don't... It'll give me diarrhea...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800661","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00015","en":"Youko: \"Ngh, ngggh, not that please... not that... it makes my belly want to empty...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000004d1:text","row":29844,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「健康そのものじゃないですか、あなた」","en":"“You're the picture of health.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800662","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00016","en":"Taichi: \"But this is health itself you know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:0000050f:text","row":29845,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"ぐいぐいと押し込む。","en":"I keep pressing down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800663","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00017","en":"Squeeze! Squeeze! I squeeze it down.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000607:text","row":29846,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「うう、つむじ……押さないで……てっぺんが変な感じする……」","en":"“Nnh, my crown... Don't press it... The top of my head feels weird...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800664","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00018","en":"Youko: \"Uhhh, the whorl... don't push it please... makes the top of the head feel weird...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:0000065b:text","row":29847,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆるゆると身をよじる。","en":"She twists slowly in my grip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800665","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00019","en":"Slowly-slow I spiral into the flesh.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese describes her slowly twisting or writhing; the English changes the subject to the narrator and introduces movement into flesh.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":0,"text":"Slowly-slow I spiral into the flesh."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:00000689:text","row":29848,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"逃がさない。","en":"I don't let her get away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800666","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00020","en":"She won't escape.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000006b5:text","row":29849,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「うりうり」","en":"“How's that, how's that?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800667","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Rubbity rubbity!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000007a5:text","row":29850,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「降参、降参」","en":"“I surrender, I surrender.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800668","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00022","en":"Youko: \"Uncle, uncle.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0211:000007cb:text","row":29851,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"昼下がり、いじめ抜いた。","en":"That afternoon, I tease her thoroughly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800669","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0034:00023","en":"The early afternoon bullying had been carried through.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
